let me sum up my experiences with this game with a short story,
Imagine you are playing as an escort (that allows you to block another person from using their special power), now imagine someone is questioning your role and you prove you ARE an escort by roleblocking said person. [3 DAYS LATER] people hang you because most of the time the other townies are "new players" (to put it lightly).
Great game but if you can play it with friends, DO.

